know what we're doing.

00:37:12.280 --> 00:37:14.800
I've always found,
you go to any website and

00:37:14.800 --> 00:37:19.380
every investors website despite the
Windows dressings, they all look the same,

00:37:19.380 --> 00:37:25.010
