00:37:28.320 --> 00:37:33.300
And today may be data science and
machine learning and

00:37:33.300 --> 00:37:37.510
artificial intelligence and
whatever the attributes are.

00:37:37.510 --> 00:37:40.591
To me, the best investments
are always the ones that

00:37:40.591 --> 00:37:42.699
don't fit in a convenient bucket.

00:37:45.888 --> 00:37:50.250
And so you think about,
I mentioned Airbnb a few minutes ago.

00:37:50.250 --> 00:37:56.202
You think about Airbnb, what bucket would
you have put three couch surfers in,

00:37:56.202 --> 00:38:00.130
