00:39:13.350 --> 00:39:20.830
But $2 billion in sales, last year,
from what seem like a little, nice

00:39:20.830 --> 00:39:25.490
little consumer toy at the beginning of
the investment, but which is now becoming

00:39:25.490 --> 00:39:30.780
a company of substance particularly as
it expands into industrial applications.

00:39:30.780 --> 00:39:37.030
So it's the, or unfortunately we
weren't an early investor in Uber.

00:39:37.030 --> 00:39:39.705
But who would've,

00:39:39.705 --> 00:39:45.380
luxury black car executive ride sharing.

