00:39:50.840 --> 00:39:53.150
It's another one of
those sorts of examples.

00:39:53.150 --> 00:39:55.830
So that's the thing to look out for.

00:39:55.830 --> 00:39:57.310
It's the unexpected.

00:39:58.370 --> 00:40:01.210
&gt;&gt; I'm going to move to
